@startuml get-manager-dashboard-demand
skinparam defaultFontName "Apple SD Gothic Neo", "Noto Sans CJK KR", sans-serif
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam maxMessageSize 260
skinparam BoxPadding 8
skinparam shadowing false
autonumber
hide footbox

title GET /api/manager/v1/dashboard/demand
caption CRB-92 · 어드민 홈 대시보드 — 수요 분석 (어떤 요청이 몰리는지). 읽기 전용, 기존 테이블만 집계 (신규 테이블 · 컬럼 없음). 개인정보를 내려주지 않아 access-log는 남기지 않음. 커피챗 요청 이력은 요청자가 탈퇴해도 그대로 셈

actor Client
participant "ManagerGuard" as Guard
participant "ValidationPipe" as Pipe
participant "ManagerDashboardController" as Controller
participant "ManagerDashboardService" as Service
participant "AdminDashboardRepository" as Repository
database PostgreSQL

Client -> Guard: GET /api/manager/v1/dashboard/demand?range=30d\nAuthorization: Bearer <manager token>
ref over Client, Guard: ManagerGuard — flow/manager-guards.puml\n401 Missing access token / Token expired / Invalid token / Manager not found
Guard -> Pipe: 통과 (admin · superadmin 모두 조회 가능)
alt range 검증 실패 (7d · 30d · 90d 중 하나, 생략하면 30d)
  Pipe -[#red]-> Client: 400 (class-validator 메시지)
end
Pipe -> Controller: getDemand(query)
Controller -> Service: getDemand(range)
Service -> Repository: demandStats(from = now - range)
par 동시에 조회 (모두 range 안의 요청 기준)
  Repository -> PostgreSQL: 학과 TOP 5: coffee_chat_request → student_profile → department\nGROUP BY department ORDER BY count DESC LIMIT 5
else
  Repository -> PostgreSQL: 회사 TOP 5: coffee_chat_request → graduated → graduated_profile → company_alias\nGROUP BY company ORDER BY count DESC LIMIT 5
else
  Repository -> PostgreSQL: 관심 분야 TOP 5: unnest(student_profile.interests) 후 GROUP BY ORDER BY count DESC LIMIT 5
else
  Repository -> PostgreSQL: 요청을 받은 현업자 수 / 활성 현업자 수\n요청을 보낸 재학생 수 / 활성 재학생 수
end
PostgreSQL --> Repository: 집계 결과
Repository --> Service: 원시 집계값
note right of Service
  비율은 서비스에서 계산 (분모 0이면 null)
end note
Service --> Controller: ManagerDashboardDemandDto
Controller --> Client: 200 {\n  range, generated_at,\n  departments: [{ name, count }], companies: [{ name, count }], interests: [{ name, count }],\n  graduated_requested_ratio, student_requested_ratio\n}

@enduml
